    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>Description</h2><p>Reference terms map concepts to standard OpenMRS dictionary concepts. &nbsp;</p><h2>Steps</h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Below are the steps to manage the concept reference terms.</span></p><ol><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Go to &quot;Administration&rarr;Manage Concept Sources&quot; and&nbsp;check whether you have the required dictionary added as concept source (check the below screenshot)</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:image ac:height=\"400\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screenshot from 2016 04 01 12 43 25.png\" /></ac:image></span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">If it is not there, create a new one using &quot;Add New Concept Source&quot;<br /></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:image ac:height=\"400\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screenshot from 2016 04 01 12 42 25.png\" /></ac:image></span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">The name and description are mandatory fields. They are free text entry fields and they do not expect any predefined values.</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /><ac:image ac:height=\"150\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screenshot from 2016-04-01 12-42-49.png\" /></ac:image></span><br /><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">After creating the concept source, create the concept reference terms. You can go to that page using &quot;Administration&rarr; Manage Concept Reference Terms&quot; navigation.</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:image ac:height=\"400\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screenshot from 2016 04 01 12 43 40.png\" /></ac:image></span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">You can add a new reference term or search for the existing reference terms and edit them.</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:image ac:height=\"150\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screenshot from 2016 04 01 12 44 09.png\" /></ac:image><br /></span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">You need to provide some key as reference term code and select the source type as it's required. You can also have other reference terms mapped to a reference term.</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span><ac:image ac:height=\"250\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screenshot from 2016-04-01 12-48-28.png\" /></ac:image><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Once you have the reference term created, you can map it to any concept using &quot;Mappings&quot; option. You can add multiple mappings for a concept.</span><br /><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:image ac:height=\"400\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screenshot from 2016 04 01 12 49 26.png\" /></ac:image><br /></span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">You just need to start typing the reference term code and the respective source will be auto-selected. Note that you can manually select the mapping relationship (like SAME-AS, NARROWER-THAN etc) and these are not configurable from the UI.&nbsp;</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span><ac:image><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screenshot from 2016 04 01 12 49 47.png\" /></ac:image><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span></li><li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">You can also create a new reference term from the edit concept page on the fly as well (see the highlighted button in the above screenshot).</span><br /><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><br /></span><ac:image ac:height=\"250\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screenshot from 2016-04-01 12-50-22.png\" /></ac:image><br /><br /></li><li>Once you add the reference terms, they will start appearing in the respective concept page in OpenMRS. A sample concept with reference terms screenshot attached below.<br /><br /><ac:image ac:height=\"400\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"OpenMRS   Viewing Concept CD4 COUNT.png\" /></ac:image><br /><br /></li></ol></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"tip\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"9e4f9769-17bb-4ca3-8e1e-b5067da8696b\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">On this Page</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"toc\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"762672fb-dc0f-425e-97b1-d972e4aa0209\" />&nbsp;</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
