      "value": "<div class=\"contentLayout2\">\n<div class=\"columnLayout two-right-sidebar\" data-layout=\"two-right-sidebar\">\n<div class=\"cell normal\" data-type=\"normal\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<h2 id=\"ConfigureReferenceTerms-Description\">Description</h2><p>Reference terms map concepts to standard OpenMRS dictionary concepts.  </p><h2 id=\"ConfigureReferenceTerms-Steps\">Steps</h2><p><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Below are the steps to manage the concept reference terms.</span></p><ol><li><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Go to &quot;Administration→Manage Concept Sources&quot; and check whether you have the required dictionary added as concept source (check the below screenshot)</span><br/><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945591/Screenshot%20from%202016%2004%2001%2012%2043%2025.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459503697493&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=806&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945591/Screenshot%20from%202016%2004%2001%2012%2043%2025.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459503697493&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"49545354\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screenshot from 2016 04 01 12 43 25.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"37945591\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\" data-media-id=\"f38d89f0-d7db-4568-8d55-842eed79ee92\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945591/Scr