sion=1&amp;modificationDate=1459504401199&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=743&amp;height=150 1x\"></span><br/></span></li><li><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">You need to provide some key as reference term code and select the source type as it's required. You can also have other reference terms mapped to a reference term.</span><br/><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945591/Screenshot%20from%202016-04-01%2012-48-28.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459504774569&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=701&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945591/Screenshot%20from%202016-04-01%2012-48-28.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459504774569&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"49545360\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screenshot from 2016-04-01 12-48-28.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"37945591\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\" data-media-id=\"ffec9d7b-6727-48eb-8903-003a4455f3fd\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945591/Screenshot%20from%202016-04-01%2012-48-28.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459504774569&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=1402&amp;height=500 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945591/Screenshot%20from%202016-04-01%2012-48-28.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459504774569&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=701&amp;height=250 1x\"></span><br/><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></li><li><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">Once you have the reference term created, you can map it to any concept using &quot;Mappings&quot; option. You can add multiple mappings for a concept.</span><br/><br/><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945591/Screenshot%20from%202016%2004%2001%2012%2049%2026.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459504952028&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=396&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945591/Screenshot%20from%202016%2004%2001%2012%2049%2026.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459504952028&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"49545361\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screenshot from 2016 04 01 12 49 26.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"37945591\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\" data-media-id=\"af153c3c-2532-4527-93ff-011b28554dd5\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945591/Screenshot%20from%202016%2004%2001%2012%2049%2026.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459504952028&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=792&amp;height=800 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945591/Screenshot%20from%202016%2004%2001%2012%2049%2026.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459504952028&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=396&amp;height=400 1x\"></span><br/></span><br/><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></li><li><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">You just need to start typing the reference term code and the respective source will be auto-selected. Note that you can manually select the mapping relationship (like SAME-AS, NARROWER-THAN etc) and these are not configurable from the UI. </span><br/><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945591/Screenshot%20from%202016%2004%2001%2012%2049%2047.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459505237975&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945591/Screenshot%20from%202016%2004%2001%2012%2049%2047.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459505237975&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"49545362\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screenshot from 2016 04 01 12 49 47.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"37945591\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\" data-media-id=\"600f018c-be4b-471a-90cb-dc896cb60294\" data-media-type=\"file\"></span><br/><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span></li><li><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\">You can also create a new reference term from the edit concept page on the fly as well (see the highlighted button in the above screenshot).</span><br/><span class=\"legacy-color-text-default\"><br/></span><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945591/Screenshot%20from%202016-04-01%2012-50-22.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459505345269&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=394&amp;height=250\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945591/Screenshot%20from%202016-04-01%2012-50-22.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459505345269&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"49545363\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"Screenshot from 2016-04-01 12-50-22.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"37945591\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\" data-media-id=\"5c43da84-8ca5-48ea-8356-6b0fbd6ef98c\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945591/Screenshot%20from%202016-04-01%2012-50-22.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459505345269&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=538&amp;height=341 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945591/Screenshot%20from%202016-04-01%2012-50-22.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459505345269&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=394&amp;height=250 1x\"></span><br/><br/></li><li>Once you add the reference terms, they will start appearing in the respective concept page in OpenMRS. A sample concept with reference terms screenshot attached below.<br/><br/><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedded-manual-size\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image\" height=\"400\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945591/OpenMRS%20%20%20Viewing%20Concept%20CD4%20COUNT.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459505627299&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=423&amp;height=400\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/37945591/OpenMRS%20%20%20Viewing%20Concept%20CD4%20COUNT.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459505627299&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"49545366\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"OpenMRS   Viewing Concept CD4 COUNT.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"37945591\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"5\" data-media-id=\"6a18938d-3ab3-4a6c-8034-5db6a09f06ec\" data-media-type=\"file\" srcset=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945591/OpenMRS%20%20%20Viewing%20Concept%20CD4%20COUNT.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459505627299&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=846&amp;height=800 2x, https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/thumbnails/37945591/OpenMRS%20%20%20Viewing%20Concept%20CD4%20COUNT.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1459505627299&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2&amp;width=423&amp;height=400 1x\"></span><br/><br/></li></ol></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cell aside\" data-type=\"aside\">\n<div class=\"innerCell\">\n<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-tip conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"9e4f9769-17bb-4ca3-8e1e-b5067da8696b\" data-macro-name=\"tip\"><p class=\"title\">On this Page</p><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-approve confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p> </p><div class=\"toc-macro client-side-toc-macro  conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"false\" data-headerelements=\"H1,H2,H3,H4,H5,H6,H7\" data-macro-id=\"762672fb-dc0f-425e-97b1-d972e4aa0209\" data-macro-name=\"toc\"> </div> <p> </p></div></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
